# What `docker buildx build -f packages/database/Dockerfile .` leaves out of
# its context (ADR-0175 Decision 3, ADR-0192). The build stage installs the
# workspace; the image itself copies the CLI's packages, `schema.prisma` and
# `migrations`. BuildKit reads this file, not a root .dockerignore. Patterns
# match from the context's root, so `**/` is what reaches every depth; no line
# may start with `!`.
**/.git
.github
**/.claude
docs
.pnpm-store
**/dist
**/out
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.vitest
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.e2e
**/.dev-storage
**/.dev-outbox
**/.dev-provider
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
**/*.log
